{"sba-keyaki-3600":{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パシフィコ横浜での個別握手会にお越し下さった皆さん本当にありがとうございました♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学校、お仕事の疲れはとれたかな?少しでも癒された〜と思ってくださっていたら嬉しいです♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日で1stシングルの握手会が終わりということを知らなくてすごく寂しい気持ちでいっぱいです(*´･_･`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっという間だったな〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また8月からは2ndの握手会が始まるのでそれまで首をなが〜くして待ってるね(*´ ˘ `*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてそして6/25はひらちのお誕生日でした♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH7ZXYG59BNQ259X2YB2762","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"合格発表のとき隣で『中学2年生なんです。』と言われたことが何よりの衝撃でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"センターというポジションでプレッシャーに押しつぶされそうになってしまうことたくさんあると思うけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーはもちろん、ファンの皆さんがひらちのことを全力で支えてるから少しでも安心してくれたら嬉しいな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"15歳、最高の1年になりますように♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はお兄ちゃんが選んでくれた洋服を着たよ〜♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH7ZYWV2VPB8TJHRTZWTP6H","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい!ふぉ。"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-6310":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Hello"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夏を感じる今日この頃"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/03/0225847/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"セミを見つけたよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/03/0225847/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昔はよく帽子をかぶって網をもって虫を入れる箱をもって、おばぁちゃんととりにいってたなぁー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/03/0225847/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしておうちで逃がしてワイワイ遊んでた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お父さんとはドジョウをとりにいったことがあるよ！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/03/0225847/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんで、今日のタイトルは皆さんが考えてくださったのでわなく、\nコメントに書いてあった文をタイトルにしてしまいました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/03/0225847/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"考えてくださった方申し訳ありません"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/03/0225847/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今後きおつけます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/03/0225847/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だってね！まあやのことミラクルガールって書いてあったんだもん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/03/0225847/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そりゃぁ意味はよくわかんないけど、かわいいんだもん〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/03/0225847/0004.gif","alt":""},{"t