ry/2012/08/03/0225847/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にありがとうございました〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/03/0225847/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/03/0225847/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/03/0225847/0015.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんで、ほんで、ラジオがおわったら\n『"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/03/0225847/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ラ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/03/0225847/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ン"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/03/0225847/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/03/0225847/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"』\nしましたよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/03/0225847/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんと、皆さんが来ないから先食べてそのままレッスンにむかったよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/03/0225847/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"三人ともお腹ペコペコリンだったから\n『.........。』\nってかんじでひたすら食べました\n最後らへんは、\n『無言だねー』\nとか、\n今日のラジオについて話したりしました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/03/0225847/0014.gif","a